description = "Data access for Zan: the System.Data connection/pool core, the System.Data.ORM (FreeSQL-style codegen ORM), native-wire drivers for MySql/Postgres/SqlServer/Sqlite/Firebird/TDengine/ODBC, Redis client, the embedded ZanDb document store, and Xlsx reading"
